{"id": "morphhb-gen-1-1", "language": "biblical_hebrew", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "בְּרֵאשִׁ֖ית בָּרָ֣א אֱלֹהִ֑ים אֵ֥ת הַשָּׁמַ֖יִם וְאֵ֥ת הָאָֽרֶץ׃", "english_text": "In the beginning, God created the heavens and the earth.", "book": "Genesis", "reference": "Genesis 1:1", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Gen.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "train", "words": [{"surface": "בְּרֵאשִׁ֖ית", "lemma": "b/7225", "strongs": "7225", "morph_code": "HR/Ncfsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "בָּרָ֣א", "lemma": "1254 a", "strongs": "1254", "morph_code": "HVqp3ms", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֱלֹהִ֑ים", "lemma": "430", "strongs": "430", "morph_code": "HNcmpa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֵ֥ת", "lemma": "853", "strongs": "853", "morph_code": "HTo", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "הַשָּׁמַ֖יִם", "lemma": "d/8064", "strongs": "8064", "morph_code": "HTd/Ncmpa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "וְאֵ֥ת", "lemma": "c/853", "strongs": "853", "morph_code": "HC/To", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "הָאָֽרֶץ", "lemma": "d/776", "strongs": "776", "morph_code": "HTd/Ncbsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}]}
{"id": "morphhb-gen-1-2", "language": "biblical_hebrew", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "וְהָאָ֗רֶץ הָיְתָ֥ה תֹ֨הוּ֙ וָבֹ֔הוּ וְחֹ֖שֶׁךְ עַל־פְּנֵ֣י תְה֑וֹם וְר֣וּחַ אֱלֹהִ֔ים מְרַחֶ֖פֶת עַל־פְּנֵ֥י הַמָּֽיִם׃", "english_text": "The earth was formless and empty. Darkness was on the surface of the deep and God’s Spirit was hovering over the surface of the waters.", "book": "Genesis", "reference": "Genesis 1:2", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Gen.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "train", "words": [{"surface": "וְהָאָ֗רֶץ", "lemma": "c/d/776", "strongs": "776", "morph_code": "HC/Td/Ncbsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "הָיְתָ֥ה", "lemma": "1961", "strongs": "1961", "morph_code": "HVqp3fs", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "תֹ֨הוּ֙", "lemma": "8414", "strongs": "8414", "morph_code": "HNcmsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "וָבֹ֔הוּ", "lemma": "c/922", "strongs": "922", "morph_code": "HC/Ncmsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "וְחֹ֖שֶׁךְ", "lemma": "c/2822", "strongs": "2822", "morph_code": "HC/Ncmsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "עַל", "lemma": "5921 a", "strongs": "5921", "morph_code": "HR", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "פְּנֵ֣י", "lemma": "6440", "strongs": "6440", "morph_code": "HNcbpc", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "תְה֑וֹם", "lemma": "8415", "strongs": "8415", "morph_code": "HNcbsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "וְר֣וּחַ", "lemma": "c/7307", "strongs": "7307", "morph_code": "HC/Ncbsc", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֱלֹהִ֔ים", "lemma": "430", "strongs": "430", "morph_code": "HNcmpa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "מְרַחֶ֖פֶת", "lemma": "7363 b",