{"id": "morphhb-gen-1-3", "language": "biblical_hebrew", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "וַיֹּ֥אמֶר אֱלֹהִ֖ים יְהִ֣י א֑וֹר וַֽיְהִי־אֽוֹר׃", "english_text": "God said, “Let there be light,” and there was light.", "book": "Genesis", "reference": "Genesis 1:3", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Gen.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "train", "words": [{"surface": "וַיֹּ֥אמֶר", "lemma": "c/559", "strongs": "559", "morph_code": "HC/Vqw3ms", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֱלֹהִ֖ים", "lemma": "430", "strongs": "430", "morph_code": "HNcmpa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "יְהִ֣י", "lemma": "1961", "strongs": "1961", "morph_code": "HVqj3ms", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "א֑וֹר", "lemma": "216", "strongs": "216", "morph_code": "HNcbsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "וַֽיְהִי", "lemma": "c/1961", "strongs": "1961", "morph_code": "HC/Vqw3ms", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֽוֹר", "lemma": "216", "strongs": "216", "morph_code": "HNcbsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}]}
{"id": "morphhb-dan-2-4", "language": "biblical_aramaic", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "וַֽיְדַבְּר֧וּ הַכַּשְׂדִּ֛ים לַמֶּ֖לֶךְ אֲרָמִ֑ית מַלְכָּא֙ לְעָלְמִ֣ין חֱיִ֔י אֱמַ֥ר חֶלְמָ֛א לעבדיך וּפִשְׁרָ֥א נְחַוֵּֽא׃", "english_text": "Then the Chaldeans spoke to the king in the Syrian language, “O king, live forever! Tell your servants the dream, and we will show the interpretation.”", "book": "Daniel", "reference": "Daniel 2:4", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Dan.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "test", "words": [{"surface": "וַֽיְדַבְּר֧וּ", "lemma": "c/1696", "strongs": "1696", "morph_code": "HC/Vpw3mp", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "הַכַּשְׂדִּ֛ים", "lemma": "d/3778", "strongs": "3778", "morph_code": "HTd/Ngmpa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "לַמֶּ֖לֶךְ", "lemma": "l/4428", "strongs": "4428", "morph_code": "HRd/Ncmsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "אֲרָמִ֑ית", "lemma": "762", "strongs": "762", "morph_code": "HNgfsa", "word_language": "hebrew"}, {"surface": "מַלְכָּא֙", "lemma": "4430", "strongs": "4430", "morph_code": "ANcmsd/Td", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "לְעָלְמִ֣ין", "lemma": "l/5957", "strongs": "5957", "morph_code": "AR/Ncmpa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "חֱיִ֔י", "lemma": "2418", "strongs": "2418", "morph_code": "AVqv2ms", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "אֱמַ֥ר", "lemma": "560", "strongs": "560", "morph_code": "AVqv2ms", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "חֶלְמָ֛א", "lemma": "2493", "strongs": "2493", "morph_code": "ANcmsd/Td", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "לעבדיך", "lemma": "l/5649", "strongs": "5649", "morph_code": "AR/Ncmpc/Sp2ms", "word_languag