{"id": "morphhb-dan-2-5", "language": "biblical_aramaic", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "עָנֵ֤ה מַלְכָּא֙ וְאָמַ֣ר לכשדיא מִלְּתָ֖א מִנִּ֣י אַזְדָּ֑א הֵ֣ן לָ֤א תְהֽוֹדְעוּנַּ֨נִי֙ חֶלְמָ֣א וּפִשְׁרֵ֔הּ הַדָּמִין֙ תִּתְעַבְד֔וּן וּבָתֵּיכ֖וֹן נְוָלִ֥י יִתְּשָׂמֽוּן׃", "english_text": "The king answered the Chaldeans, “The thing has gone from me. If you don’t make known to me the dream and its interpretation, you will be cut in pieces, and your houses will be made a dunghill.", "book": "Daniel", "reference": "Daniel 2:5", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Dan.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "test", "words": [{"surface": "עָנֵ֤ה", "lemma": "6032", "strongs": "6032", "morph_code": "AVqrmsa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "מַלְכָּא֙", "lemma": "4430", "strongs": "4430", "morph_code": "ANcmsd/Td", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "וְאָמַ֣ר", "lemma": "c/560", "strongs": "560", "morph_code": "AC/Vqrmsa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "לכשדיא", "lemma": "l/3779", "strongs": "3779", "morph_code": "AR/Ngmsd/Td", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "מִלְּתָ֖א", "lemma": "4406", "strongs": "4406", "morph_code": "ANcfsd/Td", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "מִנִּ֣י", "lemma": "4481", "strongs": "4481", "morph_code": "AR/Sp1cs", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "אַזְדָּ֑א", "lemma": "230", "strongs": "230", "morph_code": "AAafsa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "הֵ֣ן", "lemma": "2006 a", "strongs": "2006", "morph_code": "AC", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "לָ֤א", "lemma": "3809", "strongs": "3809", "morph_code": "ATn", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "תְהֽוֹדְעוּנַּ֨נִי֙", "lemma": 