{"id": "morphhb-dan-7-9", "language": "biblical_aramaic", "dialect": "biblical", "script": "Hebrew", "period": "biblical", "source_text": "חָזֵ֣ה הֲוֵ֗ית עַ֣ד דִּ֤י כָרְסָוָן֙ רְמִ֔יו וְעַתִּ֥יק יוֹמִ֖ין יְתִ֑ב לְבוּשֵׁ֣הּ׀ כִּתְלַ֣ג חִוָּ֗ר וּשְׂעַ֤ר רֵאשֵׁהּ֙ כַּעֲמַ֣ר נְקֵ֔א כָּרְסְיֵהּ֙ שְׁבִיבִ֣ין דִּי־נ֔וּר גַּלְגִּלּ֖וֹהִי נ֥וּר דָּלִֽק׃", "english_text": "“I watched until thrones were placed, and one who was Ancient of Days sat. His clothing was white as snow, and the hair of his head like pure wool. His throne was fiery flames, and its wheels burning fire.", "book": "Daniel", "reference": "Daniel 7:9", "source_edition": "Westminster Leningrad Codex (WLC) via Open Scriptures morphhb (OSHB)", "translation_edition": "World English Bible (WEB)", "license": "WLC text: Public Domain; morphhb annotations: CC BY 4.0; World English Bible: Public Domain", "provenance": "morphhb OSIS file Dan.xml (sha256 recorded in datasets manifest)", "partition": "test", "words": [{"surface": "חָזֵ֣ה", "lemma": "2370", "strongs": "2370", "morph_code": "AVqrmsa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "הֲוֵ֗ית", "lemma": "1934", "strongs": "1934", "morph_code": "AVqp1cs", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "עַ֣ד", "lemma": "5705", "strongs": "5705", "morph_code": "AR", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "דִּ֤י", "lemma": "1768", "strongs": "1768", "morph_code": "ATr", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "כָרְסָוָן֙", "lemma": "3764", "strongs": "3764", "morph_code": "ANcmpa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "רְמִ֔יו", "lemma": "7412", "strongs": "7412", "morph_code": "AVQp3mp", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "וְעַתִּ֥יק", "lemma": "c/6268", "strongs": "6268", "morph_code": "AC/Aamsc", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "יוֹמִ֖ין", "lemma": "3118", "strongs": "3118", "morph_code": "ANcmpa", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface": "יְתִ֑ב", "lemma": "3488", "strongs": "3488", "morph_code": "AVqp3ms", "word_language": "aramaic"}, {"surface":